    "expression_position": {
      "x": 12,
      "y": 476
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "ふみ",
    "text": "「『夏祭り』の取材をするついでに、『料理研の魔人』の真実を赤裸々に暴くつもりだったのに」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "right",
    "character": 25,
    "dress": "old-yukata",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-yukata_expression/sad",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 12,
      "y": 476
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "ふみ",
    "text": "「久しぶりに、一緒に取材できるんだって……。あたし嬉しかったのよ、しおん部長」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "right",
    "character": 25,
    "dress": "old-yukata",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": false,
